  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component provides static managers for tracking and querying the state of user inputs: mouse, keyboard, and gamepad. It centralizes raw input data into global state repositories, allowing other application systems to query current states without direct event listener access. It manages state changes across frames, utilizing browser APIs like navigator.getGamepads() and providing functions to reset transient frame deltas."
  },
